---
// 51Labs, "Community detection for VN100" (19 May 2025): numbers copied from the opened page.
// 3*(N-2) = 294 edges kept for N = 100 (page says "about 294"); 4,950 = 100*99/2 possible pairs.
// Steel group HPG, HSG, NKG; bank group VCB, BID, CTG. Backtest period is not stated on the page.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900, H = 400;
const rows = [
  { k: 'InfoMap', ret: '22.07', vol: '24.5', sh: 0.90, dd: '−42.85', hl: true },
  { k: 'Louvain', ret: '16.71', vol: '26.21', sh: 0.64, dd: '−47.26', hl: false },
  { k: 'VNINDEX', ret: '12.53', vol: '19.83', sh: 0.63, dd: '−40.34', hl: false },
];
const BX = 640, BW = 200;
---
<figure class="p10v">
  <div class="p10v-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Summary of a 51Labs study on 100 Vietnamese stocks. Of 4,950 possible correlation pairs, about 294 links are kept. Algorithms find communities such as steel (HPG, HSG, NKG) and banks (VCB, BID, CTG). A table gives annual return, volatility, Sharpe ratio and maximum drawdown for InfoMap, Louvain and VN-Index: Sharpe 0.90, 0.64 and 0.63, maximum drawdown −42.85, −47.26 and −40.34 percent.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="p10v-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>A real run on the Vietnamese market: 51Labs, VN100</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một lần chạy thật trên thị trường Việt Nam: 51Labs, VN100</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="48" width="260" height="150" rx="8" class="p10v-card" />
    <DiagramIcon name="network" x={48} y={76} size={24} />
    <text x="72" y="82" class="p10v-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>100 stocks</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>100 cổ phiếu</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="118" class="p10v-n">4,950</text>
    <text x="104" y="118" class="p10v-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>possible pairs</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cặp có thể</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="150" class="p10v-n is-gold">≈ 294</text>
    <text x="104" y="150" class="p10v-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>links kept (3 × (N−2))</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>liên kết giữ lại (3 × (N−2))</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="180" class="p10v-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>distance = √(2(1−ρ))</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>khoảng cách = √(2(1−ρ))</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="310" y="48" width="290" height="150" rx="8" class="p10v-card" />
    <text x="326" y="76" class="p10v-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Groups the algorithm found</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Các nhóm thuật toán tìm ra</tspan>
    </text>
    <circle cx="338" cy="106" r="7" class="p10v-dot is-steel" />
    <text x="358" y="111" class="p10v-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Steel: HPG, HSG, NKG</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thép: HPG, HSG, NKG</tspan>
    </text>
    <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={338} y={142} size={22} />
    <text x="358" y="147" class="p10v-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Banks: VCB, BID, CTG</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ngân hàng: VCB, BID, CTG</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="326" y="180" class="p10v-s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Louvain: 7 groups, InfoMap: 9</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Louvain: 7 nhóm, InfoMap: 9</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="232" class="p10v-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The strategy: buy the best-Sharpe stock of each group, equal weight, 60-day rebalance</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chiến lược: mua mã Sharpe cao nhất mỗi nhóm, tỷ trọng đều, tái cân bằng 60 ngày</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="262" class="p10v-hd" >
      <tspan data-lang-en>Annual, as reported</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Theo năm, như bài báo cáo</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="260" y="262" class="p10v-hd">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Return %</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lợi suất %</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="370" y="262" class="p10v-hd">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Volatility %</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biến động %</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="490" y="262" class="p10v-hd">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Max drawdown %</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sụt giảm tối đa %</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={BX} y="262" class="p10v-hd">Sharpe</text>
    {rows.map((r, k) => (
      <g>
        <text x="20" y={296 + k * 32} class={r.hl ? 'p10v-t' : 'p10v-s'}>{r.k}</text>
        <text x="260" y={296 + k * 32} class="p10v-s">{r.ret}</text>
        <text x="370" y={296 + k * 32} class="p10v-s">{r.vol}</text>
        <text x="490" y={296 + k * 32} class="p10v-s">{r.dd}</text>
        <rect x={BX} y={280 + k * 32} width={r.sh * BW / 1.0} height="20" rx="3" class={r.hl ? 'p10v-bar is-hl' : 'p10v-bar'} />
        <text x={BX + r.sh * BW + 8} y={296 + k * 32} class="p10v-s">{r.sh.toFixed(2)}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="20" y="390" class="p10v-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The post does not state the test period or trading costs. Both strategies had deeper drawdowns than the index.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài không nêu giai đoạn kiểm thử hay chi phí giao dịch. Cả hai chiến lược đều sụt sâu hơn chỉ số.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Grouping stocks by correlation recovers sectors without being told the sectors. Louvain and InfoMap are the graph methods of a later post.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nhóm cổ phiếu theo tương quan tìm lại được các ngành mà không cần biết trước ngành. Louvain và InfoMap là các phương pháp đồ thị của bài sau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p10v { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p10v-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p10v svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p10v text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p10v .p10v-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p10v .p10v-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p10v .p10v-s { font-size: 13.5px; }
  .p10v .p10v-n { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p10v .p10v-n.is-gold { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .p10v .p10v-hd { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p10v .p10v-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p10v-dot.is-steel { fill: var(--act-1); }
  .p10v-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p10v-bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p10v-bar.is-hl { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .p10v figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
